    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "In 2018, a CD with this version of Kira Kira Star Night was given away with completed tax returns. In 2020, the game was re-released on to a Famicom cartridge. There have been a few improvements implemented in this version of the game. Name entry and high score saving have been along with a new character sprite and a new level."
